    <item>
      <title>Mudando a inicialização do Windows</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 26 Feb 2013 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Galera!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Nesse post vou mostrar como alterar a forma de inicialização do windows, ou seja, ao invés de iniciar normalmente com o &amp;ldquo;explorer.exe&amp;rdquo;, iniciar com um programa especifico como por exemplo o internet explore.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Seguinte primeiro de tudo abra o regedit:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Aperte a tecla do Windows + R para abrir o executar do windows, digite regedit e click em ok.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://rodrigolira.eti.br/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/regedit.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;300&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;151&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/regedit-300x151.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/regedit-300x151.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/regedit-300x151.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/regedit-300x151.png&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;regedit&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Vai abrir o editor de registro do windows:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://rodrigolira.eti.br/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/editor-de-registro.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;300&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;177&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/editor-de-registro-300x177.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/editor-de-registro-300x177.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/editor-de-registro-300x177.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/mudando-a-inicializacao-do-windows/images/editor-de-registro-300x177.png&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;editor de registro&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Com o editor aberto você vai executar o seguinte passo-a-passo:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
